      "quote": "Removable orthoses have proven their value in the recovery process of other fractures of the long bones, and are increasingly suggested as an alternative to a cast for stable type B fractures [16, 17]. Both types of NOM have benefits and drawbacks, but no consensus on NOM for stable type B ankle fractures has been reached.",
